{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Warbringer rank 6 consumes Demonfire and gains 18% damage per stack (#5274, #5501)",
  "contract": [
    "Warbringer is one spell family: root 802581 with ranks 802582-802586, all named 'Warbringer' in",
    "Spell.dbc and all requiring CasterAuraSpell 500906 (Demonfire). The Knight of Xoroth scripts recognise a",
    "Warbringer rank through sSpellMgr->GetFirstSpellInChain, which reads only the spell_ranks table, and no",
    "spell_ranks row chained 802582-802586 to 802581, so only rank 1 consumed Demonfire and received the 18%",
    "per stack bonus (changelog record 66622, documented in docs/coa/knight-of-xoroth-completion.md).",
    "Original rank 6 rolls 83-92 flat normalized damage before its 65 percent weapon effect, and item 629951",
    "rolls 2.1429-4.2857 weapon damage. Two independent rolls can violate a narrow per-hit ratio even with",
    "the correct stack factor. Rank 6 802586 is cast normally 32 times at 1 and 32 times at 6 Demonfire on a",
    "level-80 golem with hit, expertise and crit ratings forcing every hit to land and crit: the cast must",
    "consume every Demonfire stack and every funded cast must land and consume all stacks, and the ratio of",
    "equal-size cohort damage totals must be (1+6*0.18)/(1+0.18) = 1.763 times the 1-stack hit."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 600000,
